  "body": "You may take an additional action each turn to play a card that costs 3 or more resources.\n⭐ effect: +1. Gain resources equal to the amount of actions you have spent this round (to a maximum of 4).",
  "flavor": "\"I'm not proud of the shortcuts I've taken in life, but I never regretted a single one.\"",
  "illustrator": "Aleksander Karcz",
  "card_number": "7",
  "encounter_group_number": "",
  "picture_base64": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
  "image_mode": 1,
